WEBVTT

00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:05.220
Good morning!

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:07.230
Good morning, Lala.

00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:08.860
Good morning, Manaka.

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:09.940
H-Head Disciplinarian!

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:14.910
G-Good morning. I'm not breaking any rules, am I?

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:17.360
You're in the green for now.

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:22.870
But you're just one ticket away from reaching the golden 200, so stay vigilant!

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.530
Capisce.

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:26.750
What is this ruckus?

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:32.300
One tasked with keeping peace disturbing the peace is madness!

00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:35.510
I'm not disturbing it. Just giving a friendly reminder.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.930
Hi! Tension max! It's Dorothy West!

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:41.290
Eh?

00:00:41.290 --> 00:00:44.180
Dorothy? Dressing Pafé's Dorothy?

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:45.140
Yes!

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:47.020
Dorothy, you...

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:50.360
You're wearing our uniform. Did you...

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:55.340
Yeah. We figured going to the same school as you would be more convenient,

00:00:55.340 --> 00:00:58.490
so we went all out and moved closer to here and everything.

00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:01.240
That's some dedication...

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:03.500
Hey Dorothy, it's me!

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:06.060
Always bringing the happiness!

00:01:06.060 --> 00:01:07.880
Lala the unstoppable!

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:11.240
Eh? Were you always so small?

00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:12.440
You're an elementary schooler?

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:15.260
I see!

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:18.160
No wonder you're so unattractive.

00:01:18.890 --> 00:01:21.420
I'm Mireille.

00:01:23.660 --> 00:01:25.060
Crazy acting skills!

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:27.020
Isn't Leona with you?

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:29.480
Yup. Right, Leona?

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:30.620
Yeah.

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:39.160
Pleased to meet you.

00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:45.440
U-Uh, you're... Leona?

00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:46.300
That's right.

00:01:46.300 --> 00:01:47.580
That can't be right!

00:01:48.010 --> 00:01:49.040
You're a boy?

00:01:49.610 --> 00:01:50.620
Yes.

00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:54.090
Eeeeeh?! Eh?

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:57.050
This wasn't in my plans!

00:03:36.130 --> 00:03:41.320
So why do you always wear girls' clothes even though you're a boy?

00:03:41.730 --> 00:03:46.150
Me and Dorothy have just always been wearing the same stuff.

00:03:46.150 --> 00:03:48.540
It's part of the idol persona.

00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:52.750
So boys can go to PriPara too?

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:55.980
It's fine, since I said so.

00:03:55.980 --> 00:03:59.710
And... because he totally got a PriTicket.

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:01.760
Just like us.

00:04:02.030 --> 00:04:03.860
Well, it's fine then.

00:04:03.860 --> 00:04:10.430
The 12th rule of PriPara does state "<i>Anyone</i> who has received a personal PriTicket may enter freely."

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:13.900
Oh, really? Capisce!

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:17.420
I see. Case closed, then.

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:19.860
I can look forward to our future collaboration.

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:21.570
Tension max!

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:22.830
Relax.

00:04:22.830 --> 00:04:23.940
Dorothy and...

00:04:23.940 --> 00:04:24.820
Leona.

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:25.950
Nice to meet you!

00:04:26.510 --> 00:04:28.040
It's Dorothy and Leona!

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:29.380
They're in our school now?

00:04:29.380 --> 00:04:31.420
Because of their team-up with Shion?

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:32.620
Whuh?!

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:37.590
Even respectable students like Toudou Shion are going to PriPara now?

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:40.240
Class is in 5 minutes. Hurry up, everyone.

00:04:40.240 --> 00:04:41.320
Chanko!

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:43.920
W-W-Wait a moment! I must inspect you for PriTickets!

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:45.660
Leona was a boy all along?

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:46.510
Whuh?

00:04:46.510 --> 00:04:47.940
Even though you're a PriPara idol?

00:04:47.940 --> 00:04:48.470
Yeah.

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:52.170
Wh-Wh-Whuh?! Even the boys are going to PriPara?

00:04:52.170 --> 00:04:54.630
The world's gone mad!

00:04:56.900 --> 00:05:01.110
Introducing our new student: Dorothy West.

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:05.490
Hi! Tension max! Dorothy West!

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:08.830
Thank your lucky stars you got to meet me!

00:05:09.430 --> 00:05:10.330
So cute!

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:11.450
The pleasure is ours!

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:16.420
Phew, just listen to that condescension. Who does she think she is?

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:22.190
What kind of girl behaves like that?

00:05:22.190 --> 00:05:25.300
Bet she thinks she's mighty cute.

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:28.070
But she's not. Not cute at all.

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:30.220
You were saying?

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:37.400
She's actually really cute! She's the best!

00:05:38.860 --> 00:05:40.040
So cute.

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:40.620
A boy!

00:05:40.620 --> 00:05:41.320
A boy?

00:05:41.620 --> 00:05:43.560
Leona's a boy?

00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:47.490
Well, he's cute, but can boys even go to PriPara?

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:50.120
Tension Relax...

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:54.450
I'm Leona West. Pleased to meet you.

00:05:54.740 --> 00:05:56.380
I lose!

00:05:56.380 --> 00:05:59.380
The gods of PriPara themselves can't deny that...

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:00.370
Yeah!

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:06.340
<i>Didn't expect we'd end up in the same class...</i>

00:06:06.680 --> 00:06:10.800
<i>She looked at him, she looked at him, she looked at him...</i>

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:13.570
Hey! Takahashi!

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:15.730
Right! Lunch time! Lunch time!

00:06:15.730 --> 00:06:18.280
Leona, let's have curry for lunch.

00:06:18.280 --> 00:06:20.350
If that's what you want, Dorothy.

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:24.310
But Leona, you promised you'd eat with us!

00:06:24.310 --> 00:06:27.400
Oh, uh... I guess we'll have to have curry tomorrow?

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:31.070
What are you going on about?
You always eat with me!

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:33.060
Uh, right...

00:06:33.060 --> 00:06:35.330
If that's what you want, Dorothy.

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:37.320
Eh? Which is it?

00:06:37.320 --> 00:06:41.540
Sucks to be you! The bonds between me and Leona are deeper than the sea!

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:42.870
Let's skedaddle, Leona!

00:06:42.870 --> 00:06:43.400
Okay.

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:45.250
They seem close.

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:48.970
Always hemming and hawing...
Pick black or white and stick with it!

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:53.550
Right. Everyone's here-usa.

00:06:53.990 --> 00:06:58.840
Let's begin our emergency meeting on strategies to defeat SoLaMi SMILE.

00:06:59.790 --> 00:07:02.200
It has been a whole month since Dressing Pafé was formed.

00:07:02.200 --> 00:07:06.190
Yet still you, my babies, haven't beaten SoLaMi SMILE even once-usa.

00:07:06.520 --> 00:07:08.080
It's only been a month!

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:10.570
We're just getting warmed up. Right, Leona?

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:12.950
If you say so, Dorothy.

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:14.830
An <i>entire</i> month, you mean!

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:17.160
The past month hasn't been merely practice.

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:20.140
We'll beat 'em in a flash once we really get serious.

00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:21.440
Nonsense.

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:22.880
Based on what evidence?

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:26.730
Damn it! Don't get sidetracked-usa!

00:07:26.730 --> 00:07:28.840
C'mon, Leona! Do your thing-usa!

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:33.330
R-Right. Play nice, you two.

00:07:33.330 --> 00:07:34.300
'Kaaay.

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:36.580
Back on topic-usa.

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:42.270
As I was saying, we need a plan to increase our presence!

00:07:42.670 --> 00:07:44.710
I suggest we start with a clean slate.

00:07:44.710 --> 00:07:47.480
Creating a new Making Drama would be a good way to go.

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:51.090
Hm? A new Making Drama-usa?

00:07:51.090 --> 00:07:53.340
<i>That could work, but...</i>

00:07:53.340 --> 00:07:57.470
<i>The last time was a huge pain with the babies' ceaseless arguing-usa...</i>

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:02.670
I suggest our new Making Drama to make more use of go pieces.

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:07.880
I want a Making Drama that focuses on how cute I am and has a lot of heart!

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:10.330
What about you?

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:13.040
Something everyone can agree on.

00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:14.280
Again with that...

00:08:14.280 --> 00:08:15.090
What?

00:08:15.450 --> 00:08:17.810
Don't you have an opinion of your own?

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:19.770
Uh... My own?

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:23.980
I can't respect someone who always simply goes along with what others say.

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:26.260
What's with you?

00:08:26.260 --> 00:08:28.050
Yep, called it.

00:08:28.050 --> 00:08:33.440
I want my teammates to be constantly pushing to better themselves.

00:08:33.440 --> 00:08:36.460
We are to chase each other ever closer to the top, to help each other.

00:08:37.960 --> 00:08:39.950
I'll hear out your complaints!

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:46.800
Do you truly have what it takes to be an idol, if all you ever do is hide in Dorothy's shadow?

00:08:48.510 --> 00:08:50.860
We're a two-in-one deal, so it's fine!

00:08:50.860 --> 00:08:52.550
I'm asking <i>Leona.</i>

00:08:52.950 --> 00:08:53.910
Leona...

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:59.220
This is a good opportunity. You will create our next Making Drama by yourself.

00:08:59.220 --> 00:09:00.510
Eh?

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:03.390
Show us what <i>you</i> want to do.

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:07.480
Hey, that's not for you to decide, Shion!

00:09:21.350 --> 00:09:24.060
Shion? Have you seen Leona?

00:09:24.060 --> 00:09:24.620
No.

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:29.130
What do we do? He seemed down all day yesterday...

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:31.550
And he's been hiding from me today.

00:09:32.290 --> 00:09:34.550
If something happens to him, it'll be your fault!

00:09:36.330 --> 00:09:40.850
Any stirring in his shut off heart can only be a step forward.

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:47.140
The Moon...

00:09:49.300 --> 00:09:50.400
The Moon.

00:09:54.140 --> 00:09:55.700
J-Jellyfish?!

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:00.200
S-Sophie?

00:10:01.060 --> 00:10:01.830
Yes.

00:10:02.940 --> 00:10:04.620
You surprised me there.

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:08.080
Sorry. You're just so different outside PriPara.

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:11.230
I'm pretty frail.

00:10:11.230 --> 00:10:13.550
Wherever I lay down is bed.

00:10:15.820 --> 00:10:17.260
I see.

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:20.530
Looking at the Moon?

00:10:21.030 --> 00:10:22.710
It reminds me of myself.

00:10:22.710 --> 00:10:23.730
Yourself?

00:10:24.820 --> 00:10:29.110
I'm the Moon and Dorothy is a brightly blazing sun.

00:10:29.110 --> 00:10:31.440
I only shine thanks to her.

00:10:33.700 --> 00:10:37.110
But that isn't enough, is it?

00:10:38.220 --> 00:10:40.570
You and me might be the same.

00:10:41.090 --> 00:10:42.280
The same?

00:10:42.810 --> 00:10:46.250
"Jellyfish" is written "moon of the sea" in Japanese.

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:47.690
Does that count?

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:56.190
Paprika Private Academy Rule #192:

00:10:56.190 --> 00:10:59.380
Sneezing in front of the founder's statue is strictly prohibited.

00:10:59.860 --> 00:11:03.890
You long-awaited golden 200th warning ticket!

00:11:05.020 --> 00:11:06.350
Wh-What do I do now?

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:09.180
Y-You've finally hit gold!

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:11.310
Any student who receives a golden ticket must...

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:13.270
Must...

00:11:13.590 --> 00:11:20.490
Volunteer to look after Paprika preschoolers on an orientation trip around the elementary school facilities.

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:23.310
What, that's all?

00:11:23.310 --> 00:11:26.950
Phew. Capisce!

00:11:27.680 --> 00:11:33.020
I used to always let my sister, Cosmo, and the Royal Guard do everything for me.

00:11:33.690 --> 00:11:37.340
But those two gave me the chance to change.

00:11:37.820 --> 00:11:41.620
Once you realize you're thinking of changing, you've already

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:44.240
begun to change.

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:46.780
Yes!

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:55.630
What do I want to make a Making Drama about?

00:11:55.630 --> 00:11:56.750
Leona!

00:11:57.630 --> 00:11:59.620
I've been looking all over for you!

00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:02.030
I'm sorry, Dorothy...

00:12:02.430 --> 00:12:06.720
Don't let what Shion said get to you.

00:12:07.220 --> 00:12:08.020
I'm not.

00:12:09.810 --> 00:12:14.990
Now we'll head to the school gym to meet all the elementary schoolers!

00:12:14.990 --> 00:12:17.810
Make sure you don't get lost!

00:12:17.810 --> 00:12:18.880
You too!

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:22.590
Capisce!

00:12:25.580 --> 00:12:27.550
The preschoolers are making fun of her...

00:12:27.920 --> 00:12:31.270
A child looking after children. A strange sight indeed.

00:12:32.550 --> 00:12:33.480
I'll do what I can!

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:36.650
Pardon me.

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:38.720
Are you unhurt?

00:12:41.010 --> 00:12:41.780
Stop crying!

00:12:45.250 --> 00:12:46.930
"Stop crying" means stop!

00:12:46.930 --> 00:12:47.990
Are you okay?

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:51.720
Isn't being yelled at like that just scary?

00:12:51.720 --> 00:12:53.710
It's no good. This calls for...

00:12:54.320 --> 00:12:57.420
Hi! Tension max! It's Dorothy!

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:01.380
I think he's even more scared of you.

00:13:01.720 --> 00:13:03.500
Th-That's not true!

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:06.800
Round 2! Tension max! It's Dorothy!

00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:08.420
Max Beam!

00:13:09.490 --> 00:13:10.830
Stop maxing!

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:13.770
Uh, Dorothy?

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:17.440
Come on! My Max Beam can make anyone stop crying!

00:13:18.220 --> 00:13:18.980
Huh?

00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:22.440
Hey! Guys!

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:24.490
Round them up!

00:13:24.490 --> 00:13:26.200
Wait!

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:27.910
Stop!

00:13:31.670 --> 00:13:32.950
Are you okay?

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:39.340
Miss!

00:13:39.980 --> 00:13:41.250
Miss!

00:13:41.850 --> 00:13:43.060
Leona!

00:13:43.060 --> 00:13:45.640
What a wonderful talent for understanding children!

00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:47.310
9 secured!

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:51.600
Where's the last one?

00:13:51.910 --> 00:13:53.520
Uh...

00:13:56.380 --> 00:13:58.010
Everything's okay now.

00:13:58.010 --> 00:13:59.440
But my balloon...

00:14:02.370 --> 00:14:04.780
Won't take long. I'll get it back.

00:14:07.770 --> 00:14:09.540
That is physically impossible.

00:14:09.540 --> 00:14:10.570
Quite.

00:14:10.860 --> 00:14:12.980
You have to help, Miss!

00:14:12.980 --> 00:14:13.880
Help her!

00:14:13.880 --> 00:14:14.870
Get it back!

00:14:16.060 --> 00:14:18.330
If you say so.

00:14:26.150 --> 00:14:28.720
Whoa, that's amazing!

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:36.170
All right! Amazing work!

00:14:36.170 --> 00:14:38.120
Thank you, Leona!

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:40.650
Here.

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:41.690
Yay!

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:43.810
Play with us, Miss!

00:14:43.810 --> 00:14:44.730
Okay.

00:14:47.760 --> 00:14:52.680
I see. He does truly love helping others.

00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:54.450
It took you this long to notice?

00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:57.330
Everyone else's happiness is Leona's happiness.

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:59.540
Quite unlike a certain someone we know.

00:14:59.540 --> 00:15:01.830
Yeah yeah, he's much nicer than me!

00:15:03.180 --> 00:15:06.800
I certainly can't deny the purity of his kindness.

00:15:07.820 --> 00:15:10.260
I must accept it without reservation.

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:12.720
Yeah.

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:15.390
This is so fun, Miss!

00:15:18.010 --> 00:15:19.470
Yeah, it is!

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:22.820
Miss!

00:15:24.740 --> 00:15:29.280
<i>That's right! This is it! This is the feeling!</i>

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:31.530
You've done it!

00:15:31.880 --> 00:15:33.730
Well done, Leona!

00:15:33.730 --> 00:15:35.740
Let's take the fight to SoLaMi SMILE with this!

00:15:36.360 --> 00:15:37.200
Yeah!

00:15:38.260 --> 00:15:41.470
Okay! We're beating Dressing Pafé today!

00:15:41.470 --> 00:15:42.420
Yeah!

00:15:44.800 --> 00:15:46.840
Scan the appropriate amount of My Tickets for your Coord.

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:50.090
You may also scan Friend Tickets.

00:15:52.120 --> 00:15:53.950
Coord Change Start!

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:33.570
Making Drama Switch On!

00:16:34.730 --> 00:16:38.010
Save us! Someone save us!

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:39.520
Save us-pri!

00:16:45.280 --> 00:16:48.730
Liberation Maiden Valkyria!

00:16:50.120 --> 00:16:52.640
Cyalume Change!

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:20.850
Lady Sophie!

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:21.970
Chanko!

00:17:23.150 --> 00:17:28.470
Fresh Marching Coord from the cheerful pop style brand Fortune Party.

00:17:28.470 --> 00:17:30.940
Fresh Marching Star!

00:17:30.940 --> 00:17:32.480
Go!

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:38.770
The relief printed patterns on the sleeves and skirt result in a very classy feel!

00:17:38.770 --> 00:17:40.890
Sapphire Marching Star!

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:49.080
Let's see a perfectly coordinated show, like a marching parade!

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:51.410
Amethyst Marching Star!

00:18:46.220 --> 00:18:49.120
<i>Seeing everyone happy and smiling.</i>

00:18:49.120 --> 00:18:54.360
<i>That's what I really want.</i>

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:04.830
Making Drama Switch On!

00:19:11.530 --> 00:19:14.720
For the smiles! All Out Dash!

00:19:14.720 --> 00:19:16.530
All Out Dash!

00:19:17.060 --> 00:19:19.200
All Out Dash!

00:19:19.910 --> 00:19:22.460
Fly, Balloon!

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:32.280
Cyalume Change!

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:09.370
Dressing Pafé's got a different shine than before-pri.

00:20:09.370 --> 00:20:10.810
Sparkles everywhere!

00:20:10.810 --> 00:20:12.590
And now, the scoring!

00:20:12.590 --> 00:20:14.960
Which one of our teams scored the most likes?

00:20:14.960 --> 00:20:17.320
SoLaMi SMILE or Dressing Pafé?

00:20:18.720 --> 00:20:23.800
Oh my! Pushing past SoLaMi SMILE for the first time, Dressing Pafé wins!

00:20:23.800 --> 00:20:28.200
And Leona West ranks up to Promising Idol!

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:34.580
All right! That's great, Leona!

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:38.300
Your Making Drama boosted you to the same rank as me!

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:39.760
Same rank!

00:20:40.360 --> 00:20:41.330
Leona!

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:44.910
I finally understand you.

00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:48.100
You are a worthy teammate, and you have my gratitude.

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:50.560
And thank you, Shion!

00:20:50.840 --> 00:20:55.020
All right! This calls for a carrot juice party-usa!

00:20:55.340 --> 00:20:57.040
This is the worst-kuma!

00:20:57.040 --> 00:21:00.980
But this will only steel my resolve to work even harder-kuma!

00:21:04.220 --> 00:21:06.380
Thank you, Sophie.

00:21:06.380 --> 00:21:13.280
From now on, I'll try to make sure to not forget my own thoughts in favor of others'.

00:21:13.280 --> 00:21:14.560
Good.

00:21:15.080 --> 00:21:17.620
It's all thanks to you that I realized!

00:21:17.620 --> 00:21:18.860
Thanks to me?

00:21:18.860 --> 00:21:19.540
Yes!

00:21:20.460 --> 00:21:22.070
Thanks to me...

00:23:06.930 --> 00:23:09.750
It's been almost a year since you started out at PriPara, Mireille!

00:23:09.750 --> 00:23:11.360
It's really been that long-pri...

00:23:11.360 --> 00:23:15.190
And you've made it this far thanks to your expert manager!

00:23:15.190 --> 00:23:20.330
Huh? You're the one whose career I saved, <i>you</i> should be thankful-pri!

00:23:20.330 --> 00:23:23.040
Huh? Stop talking nonsense! <i>You</i> need to thank <i>me</i>-kuma!

00:23:23.040 --> 00:23:23.880
No, you-pri!

00:23:23.880 --> 00:23:24.290
No, you-kuma!

00:23:24.660 --> 00:23:25.440
No, you-pri!

00:23:25.440 --> 00:23:26.340
Can it with the pripri-kuma!

00:23:26.340 --> 00:23:28.220
You can it with the kumakuma-pri!

00:23:28.220 --> 00:23:32.130
Next time? Mireille And Kuma, A Destined Meeting-pri-kuma!
